    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Two-handed maul forged around a sept-tuning-fork. The head hums a single note when drawn — the note matches the wielder's name when spoken aloud.</p><p><b>Resonant.</b> On a clean hit, the target's next manifestation has +1 misfire bias.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Resonant: on hit, target's next manifestation rolls misfire with +1 bias.</p>\n<ul>\n <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d12 Sephirotic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(resonance)</span></li>\n <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Violence)</li>\n <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T1</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->"
